  "scope": "Experimental guarded dead fourth-channel deletion. Fast only with all exception masks and existing DE/UE/PE sticky flags, bounded finite fourth coefficients and initial fourth extrema, and each finite XYZ vertex abs<=128. Deleted fourth operations can then only raise already-set DE/UE/PE, never IE/ZE/OE. Original XYZ operation order and live outputs retained. Any failed guard resumes untouched original scalar loop, even after a fast prefix. Fourth extrema are private dead temporaries; no final box field uses them. RDX/R9 integer scratch dead before original output code overwrites them. Guarded native implementation. Register chained original unwind information for all new executable instructions.",
